.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "snakepit run" 1  "snakepit run " 
.SH NAME
snakepit run \- ▶️  Run a command in the snakepit Python environment
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsnakepit run\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
▶️  Run a command in the snakepit Python environment
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fICOMMAND\fR]
The command and arguments to run (use \-\- to separate args)
